{
    "title": "Little Panda's Ice Cream Games",
    "description": "Welcome to Little Panda's Ice Cream Game\u2014an ice cream paradise that kids can only dream of! Here, you'll find ice cream shops, fast food trucks, bakeries, and more! You can make ice cream, cook delicious food, and join various ice cream challenges! Discover ice cream fun like no other here!\r\n\r\nBECOME AN ICE CREAM MAKER\r\nHere, you can make all kinds of ice cream all by yourself: rainbow popsicles, cone ice cream, fried yogurt ice cream, fruit smoothies, strawberry milkshakes, and even Halloween- and Christmas-themed ice cream! You can also develop creative ice cream recipes!\r\n\r\nENJOY COOKING\r\nFrom freezing popsicles in a popsicle factory to cooking hamburgers in a fast food restaurant and baking cakes in a bakery, you can do whatever you want! Here, feel free to cook any food to your liking!\r\n\r\nTAKE ON ICE CREAM CHALLENGES\r\nExciting challenges await at different ice cream trucks! Join now! Complete tasks like stacking popsicles, piping cream, and dessert bumper cars to earn lots of coins and mysterious prizes!\r\n\r\nCREATE YOUR OWN CHARACTERS\r\nCustomize your characters according to your personal preferences, from facial features and skin to hair and clothes. Create charming character images! Explore the paradise, enjoy making ice cream and other yummy foods, and take up challenges with them!\r\n\r\nCan't wait to get started? Then enter Little Panda's Ice Cream Game now and start your creative journey of food making in the ice cream paradise!\r\n\r\nFEATURES:\r\n- The ice cream game designed for kids;\r\n- Includes several stores such as the ice cream shop, fast food store, and cake store;\r\n- Offers multiple themed ice cream trucks with different ice cream-making methods;\r\n- Provides rich skins, hairstyles, etc., allowing you to customize your characters;\r\n- Multiple ingredients, decorations, and props to choose from;\r\n- Lots of automated machines to increase cooking fun!\r\n- Lots of coins and ingredient rewards to collect;\r\n- Adds different themes of ice cream according to popular festivals;\r\n- Easy to operate for kids!\r\n\r\nAbout BabyBus\r\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\r\nAt BabyBus, we dedicate ourselves to sparking kids' creativity, imagination and curiosity,and designing our products through the kids' perspective to help them explore the world on their own.\r\n\r\nNow BabyBus offers a wide variety of products, videos and other educational content for over 600 million fans from ages 0-8 around the world! We have released over 200 children's apps, over 2500 episodes of nursery rhymes and animations, over 9000 stories  of various themes spanning the Health, Language, Society, Science, Art and other fields.\r\n\r\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\r\nContact us: ser@babybus.com\r\nVisit us: http://www.babybus.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to Little Panda&#39;s Ice Cream Game\u2014an ice cream paradise that kids can only dream of! Here, you&#39;ll find ice cream shops, fast food trucks, bakeries, and more! You can make ice cream, cook delicious food, and join various ice cream challenges! Discover ice cream fun like no other here!<br><br>BECOME AN ICE CREAM MAKER<br>Here, you can make all kinds of ice cream all by yourself: rainbow popsicles, cone ice cream, fried yogurt ice cream, fruit smoothies, strawberry milkshakes, and even Halloween- and Christmas-themed ice cream! You can also develop creative ice cream recipes!<br><br>ENJOY COOKING<br>From freezing popsicles in a popsicle factory to cooking hamburgers in a fast food restaurant and baking cakes in a bakery, you can do whatever you want! Here, feel free to cook any food to your liking!<br><br>TAKE ON ICE CREAM CHALLENGES<br>Exciting challenges await at different ice cream trucks! Join now! Complete tasks like stacking popsicles, piping cream, and dessert bumper cars to earn lots of coins and mysterious prizes!<br><br>CREATE YOUR OWN CHARACTERS<br>Customize your characters according to your personal preferences, from facial features and skin to hair and clothes. Create charming character images! Explore the paradise, enjoy making ice cream and other yummy foods, and take up challenges with them!<br><br>Can&#39;t wait to get started? Then enter Little Panda&#39;s Ice Cream Game now and start your creative journey of food making in the ice cream paradise!<br><br>FEATURES:<br>- The ice cream game designed for kids;<br>- Includes several stores such as the ice cream shop, fast food store, and cake store;<br>- Offers multiple themed ice cream trucks with different ice cream-making methods;<br>- Provides rich skins, hairstyles, etc., allowing you to customize your characters;<br>- Multiple ingredients, decorations, and props to choose from;<br>- Lots of automated machines to increase cooking fun!<br>- Lots of coins and ingredient rewards to collect;<br>- Adds different themes of ice cream according to popular festivals;<br>- Easy to operate for kids!<br><br>About BabyBus<br>\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014<br>At BabyBus, we dedicate ourselves to sparking kids&#39; creativity, imagination and curiosity,and designing our products through the kids&#39; perspective to help them explore the world on their own.<br><br>Now BabyBus offers a wide variety of products, videos and other educational content for over 600 million fans from ages 0-8 around the world! We have released over 200 children&#39;s apps, over 2500 episodes of nursery rhymes and animations, over 9000 stories  of various themes spanning the Health, Language, Society, Science, Art and other fields.<br><br>\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014<br>Contact us: ser@babybus.com<br>Visit us: http://www.babybus.com",
